## Complete MCP Apps Architecture

### 1. **MCP App Entry Point** - [compose/engine/mcp-app.tsx](compose/engine/mcp-app.tsx)

The standalone MCP App is a React application using `@modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps/react` to communicate with MCP hosts:

```typescript
// #region 🔖Header
// [👤compose📚engine💻mcpapp](repo://p/u/compose/b/l/engine/f/mcp-app.tsx)

// 2026 Ueli Saluz <ueli@semio-tech.com>

// Specs: Standalone MCP App entry point. Receives pre-computed diagram data from
// tool results and renders a lightweight UI with diagram + kit artifact selection.
// Summary: MCP App rendering a design diagram plus kit artifact selector.

import * as React from "react";
import { createRoot } from "react-dom/client";
import { useApp } from "@modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps/react";
import type { App as McpAppInstance } from "@modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps";

// Key Features:
// - Inlined KitArtifactSelect component (no @compose/ui dependency to avoid Three.js, @semio-tech/compose-js deps)
// - DiagramTypes interface for points and lines with status tracking
// - SVG-based diagram rendering with pan/zoom capabilities
// - Piece and connection selection with hover states
// - Full interactive support for design visualization
```

### 2. **Vite MCP App Build Config** - [compose/engine/vite.mcp-app.config.ts](compose/engine/vite.mcp-app.config.ts)

```typescript
// Specs: Vite config for building the standalone MCP App as a single HTML file.
// Bundles React and @modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps only. No @compose/ui or heavy deps.

// Key Components:
// - zodJitlessPlugin: Disables Zod v4 JIT compilation to avoid CSP eval violations
// - viteSingleFile: Bundles everything into a single HTML file (~322KB, 95KB gzip)
// - Patches Zod's allowsEval and Doc.compile() to prevent dynamic code generation
```

### 3. **MCP App HTML Entry Point** - [compose/engine/mcp-app.html](compose/engine/mcp-app.html)

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>compose design viewer</title>
    <style>
      /* CSS Variables for theme:
         --foreground, --accent, --accent-secondary
         --color-new, --color-modified, --color-removed
         Dark/light mode support */
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="root"></div>
    <script type="module" src="./mcp-app.tsx"></script>
  </body>
</html>
```

